   "evidence": "HEAD issueRunObservations selects every run's prompt and source reference without filtering. Before its first await, issue-queue.ts:250 executes `new Map(factory.store.issueRunObservations().map((run) => [run.id, decision(run)]))`; decision calls linkedIssues, which additionally performs an ownership lookup per run. Base subscribes directly and has no all-run comparison seed. The offline benchmark used the actual head queue and a temporary copy of the base queue with import paths redirected to unchanged dependencies, sharing identical in-memory fixtures: approximately 4 KB prompts, 30% review rounds, completed lifecycle observations, and 60 issues requiring reapproval. Results are medians from five alternating warmed polls. This confirms added blocking work and history-dependent growth, but does not reproduce the reviewer's exact 36\u201338 ms measurement or establish incorrect admissions or a factory outage; substantial impact requires larger histories. The request to report PR timings is a process matter, separate from this code regression."
